			"originalText": "192.168.1.0/24 (CIDR notation)\n24 bits are reserverd for IP\nWhen Ip Converted to Binary first 24 bits are reserved\nMeans frst 3 Octet of IP Will be same for any device in this Network.\n192.168.1 this will be same for all device which will be connected or are connected. \n3 Octet reserverd for IP and last octet Reserved for Host / device.",
